                <chunk name="Container">
                  <items count="5">
                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Creates the targets of a pick and place with a gripper tool: joint moves to points above the pick and place, linear moves in and out along the tool's Z axis, and Set Gripper commands that open, grip the part and let it go. With lists of picks and places, outputs one branch of targets per part.</item>
